        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9588/50, 2\" Contemporary Rectangular Drop Pull Ring</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 2 Icnh Contemporary Rectangular Drop Pull Ring is great for cabinets or furniture. This contemporary rectangular ring pull must be mortised (door face cut out) 5/8 inches into the door's face. The mortising can be done with a router or small wood chisel. Choose from an array of stunning finishes for Contemporary Rectangular Ring Pull.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nCan be used on sliding by-pass doors. <b>Thru-Bolt mounted</b> from the back side with #8-32 screws (just like a cabinet door pull handle or cabinet knob). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Contemporary Rectangular Drop Pull Ring\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>\r\nThis item is being discontinued. Very limited quantities available.</b>\r\n</p>",
